  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Charming Beach House offers the perfect blend of coastal relaxation and outdoor adventure. Located just a 2-minute drive (or a pleasant half-mile walk) to the beach, this home provides quick access to sugar-white sand and emerald waters. <br><br>Bring your paddle boards or kayaks! Guests can also enjoy the community dock on Lake Powell, the largest coastal dune lake in North America, ideal for kayaking, canoeing, paddleboarding, or simply watching unforgettable sunsets. The property borders Camp Helen State Park, giving nature lovers immediate access to scenic trails and protected wildlife areas. Don't forget the fishing gear!<br><br>Inside, the home features an open kitchen, dining, and living area designed for easy gathering and entertaining. With four bedrooms, it comfortably accommodates families and groups. One bedroom is conveniently located on the ground floor, while the second level includes the primary suite, an additional guest room, and a bunk room perfect for children or teens. .<br><br>Relax outdoors on the covered front porch or unwind on the shaded side porch. The community pool and clubhouse sit right on the lake, offering a serene spot to cool off or enjoy the view. Enjoy the community grill by the pool. The house does not have a grill.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Kid-Friendly Coastal Retreat • Near 30A & Shopping"
        }
      ],
